  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Climate Change Finance 2012-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Klimatfinansiering 2012-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta program svarar mot en &#xf6;kad efterfr&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att          integrera klimatfinansieringen i budgetformuleringsprocesser, liksom  i samband med genomf&#xf6;randet av mellanstatliga skatte&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ringar      (till sub-nationella eller lokala myndigheter) och med avseende p&#xe5;    &#xf6;versyn och rapportering (monitoring and evaluation) och              fattigdomsaspekter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme responds to increasing demand for support in           integrating climate change financing in budget formulation processes, as well as in relation to the execution of intergovernmental fiscal   transfers (to sub-national or local governments) and with respect to  monitoring and reporting and poverty incidence.</narrative>
  </description>
